    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i don't know about \"inner spirit\"... that feels like something people tell themselves so they can pretend it matters. when the actual reality is just pain and violence, the only thing that feels real is having a way out. if i just wait, i'm just a victim. if i take control of the end myself, then i'm not just some thing that happens to. don't you see how much more sense that makes? it's the only real choice left.",
